message.content:
{"translation":"Before my bed a pool of light,
I take it for the frost upon the ground.
Raising my head, I gaze on the bright moon;
Lowering it, I think of home."}

{"translation":"Before my bed, a pool of light —
I wonder if it's frost on the ground.

I raise my head to gaze at the bright moon;
I lower it, and think of my hometown."}

{"translation":"Before my bed, bright moonlight gleams—
I wonder if it's frost upon the ground.
I raise my head and gaze at the full moon;
I lower my head, and thoughts of home abound."}

{"translation":"Before my bed, a pool of moonlight gleams—
I take it for frost upon the ground.
I raise my head to gaze at the bright moon;
I lower it, and think of my far hometown."}

Before my bed the bright moonlight gleams;  
I mistake it for frost on the ground.  
I raise my head to gaze at the bright moon;  
I lower it and think of my hometown.

