{"translation": "I dwell at the Yangtze's head, you dwell at the Yangtze's tail;
Daily I think of you, yet see you not — we share one river's water.
When shall this water ever cease, when shall this longing ever end?
I only wish your heart as mine — then never would such love be betrayed."}

