{"translation":"I dwell at the Yangtze’s source, you at its end;  
Day after day I think of you, yet cannot see your face—  
We share the same river’s flow.  
How long before this water stops? How soon will this sorrow cease?  
I only wish your heart may be like mine—  
Surely never to betray the bond of longing."}

